t of the herd leave their home and embark on a quest full of thrills and spills, highs and lows, laughter and adventure while traveling to exotic new lands and locations.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":98566,\"title\":\"Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/azL2ThbJMIkts3ZMt3j1YgBUeDB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eezsbzYPbYKjjh6E1XHDBNlLynh.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a kingpin threatens New York City, a group of mutated turtle warriors must emerge from the shadows to protect their home.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":404368,\"title\":\"Ralph Breaks the Internet\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iVCrhBcpDaHGvv7CLYbK6PuXZo1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qDQEQbgP3v7B9IYLAUcYexNrVYP.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Video game bad guy Ralph and fellow misfit Vanellope von Schweetz must risk it all by traveling to the World Wide Web in search of a replacement part to save Vanellope's video game, Sugar Rush. In way over their heads, Ralph and Vanellope rely on the citizens of the internet — the netizens — to help navigate their way, including an entrepreneur named Yesss, who is the head algorithm and the heart and soul of trend-making site BuzzzTube.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":893723,\"title\":\"PAW Patrol: The Mighty Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aTvePCU7exLepwg5hWySjwxojQK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zgQQF04u3OgNBJqClRNby1FPz9s.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A magical meteor crash lands in Adventure City and gives the PAW Patrol pups superpowers, transforming them into The Mighty Pups.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUnt